# Copy to .env.local and fill in to enable the AI "Draft outreach" feature.
# Everything else (Maps scraping, Reddit intent, search links, Excel/WhatsApp
# export) works WITHOUT any of these.

# Required only for AI drafting. Get one at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional — which Claude model writes the outreach. Defaults to claude-opus-4-8.
# For cheaper bulk drafting you can use claude-haiku-4-5.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# Optional — point Playwright at an existing Chromium instead of the bundled one.
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_PATH=

# Optional — a Jina key (https://jina.ai) raises rate limits for (a) the
# website-enrichment fallback that reads JS-heavy sites and (b) the web-wide
# Intent Radar search. Both work WITHOUT a key (free tier).
# JINA_API_KEY=

# Optional — an Exa key (https://exa.ai) adds high-quality semantic web results
# to the Intent Radar. Left unset, Exa is simply skipped (Reddit + HN + Web
# still run free).
# EXA_API_KEY=
